{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/872843-horror-and-horror-merging-questions","id":872843,"title":"Horror and horror merging questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-23T20:40:11-07:00","id":872843,"title":"Horror and horror merging questions","content":"Okay, just borrowed my brothers copy of the pdf(plan to run a game soon) and for the life of me there are a few things I can't find.<br /> <br /> Where is the info on your horror? Yes I know it has a thing on page 99 saying your horror has the highest of your power stats as its power, finesse stats as finesse and resistance stats as resistance, with a pool of lair x2 points to spend to buff them(+ size) up. But that is it. How dos it want me to calculate its health, regular size, speed etc? Is there a blurb in the back I'm missing? Is it just you with those stats? Is it something else?<br /> <br /> Second, what happens when you merge? The page 99 thing really didn't explain this at all for me. Do you take on the horrors power,finesse, resistance? As far as Ive seen when you merge with your horror you take the worse health bar between the two of you.<br /> <br /> Anyway thanks in advance for any help, a part of me thinks I'm just blind and missed something super obvious, another part of me fears my brother gave me an older copy of the pdf and I'm missing things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11660-sleepychicken","name":"SleepyChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11660_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T20:58:00-07:00","id":872860,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SleepyChicken</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/872843-horror-and-horror-merging-questions#post872843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where is the info on your horror? Yes I know it has a thing on page 99 saying your horror has the highest of your power stats as its power, finesse stats as finesse and resistance stats as resistance, with a pool of lair x2 points to spend to buff them(+ size) up. But that is it. How dos it want me to calculate its health, regular size, speed etc? Is there a blurb in the back I'm missing? Is it just you with those stats? Is it something else?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's just you with those stat modifications and with Dream Health instead of regular Health. The Ephemeral Beings rules section on Other Traits on p187 covers some of the adjustments.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Second, what happens when you merge? The page 99 thing really didn't explain this at all for me. Do you take on the horrors power,finesse, resistance? As far as Ive seen when you merge with your horror you take the worse health bar between the two of you. </div> </div> </div>You get to use the better stats and are by definition in a place where you can use your Atavisms' effects without losing Satiety, along with being able to heal in the Lair.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-23T21:19:12-07:00","id":872870,"title":"","content":"thanks man, this cleared a lot of things up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11660-sleepychicken","name":"SleepyChicken","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11660_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}